  "goodToKnow": "Die Panikmache is scaremongering, deliberately or exaggeratedly spreading fear: Das ist doch Panikmache! It's a common accusation in debates about health risks, climate or crime. In Panik geraten means to panic, and die Panikattacke is a panic attack. The suffix -mache (making) is colloquial and critical, as in die Stimmungsmache (stirring up opinion). It has no plural."
